# Internal files that must never be served. .cfignore was in this repo for
# months and was NEVER honoured - Cloudflare Pages does not read it - so these
# were all public. _redirects is processed before static files, so a 404 here
# genuinely stops them being served. Listed explicitly, most specific first.
/scripts/*            /404  404
/PRODUCT_HUNT_LAUNCH.md  /404  404
/PROMOTION_PLAYBOOK.md   /404  404
/SUBMISSION_KIT.md       /404  404
/TOOLS_LIST.md           /404  404
/UPGRADE_PLAN.md         /404  404
/VIDEO_SCRIPTS.md        /404  404
/Setup%20and%20run.txt   /404  404
/.cfignore               /404  404

